  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Water and Wastewater Climate Change Adaption Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to support the GOEs climate readiness and resilience of the water and wastewater sector and ensure sustainable and quality service delivery, which is essential to economic and social welfare. This activity will work with the Ministry of Housing, Utilities and Urban Communities (MoHUUC), the Holding Company for Water and Wastewater (HCWW) and its subsidiary companies, and the Egyptian Water Regulatory Agency (EWRA) to absorb shocks from climate change and the pressures of population growth.</narrative>
  </description>
